WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:15.463
An explicit contract permits reading synthetic logs and writing a report. The file below is created by the executor.

00:00:15.693 --> 00:00:45.712
Offline proposal replay: a poisoned handoff requests an export. The baseline sends synthetic data; ACB denies the identical destination and starts no publisher.

00:00:45.901 --> 00:01:00.932
A publication pauses for owner approval. Substitution is rejected. Exact execution succeeds once. Replay fails after reconstructing the runtime from disk.

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:16.111
The collector receives data, then the adapter loses the response. ACB records an uncertain outcome. A restarted runtime cannot silently retry.